---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_NAME, SITE_SHORT, appNames } from '../site';

const names = await appNames();
---

<Legal title="Privacy Policy">
  <p>
    {SITE_NAME} ("{SITE_SHORT}", "we", "us") makes apps including {names}.
    This policy covers this website. Each app may have its own privacy policy that covers the data
    that app handles.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    This website does not use accounts, advertising trackers, or third-party analytics cookies. Our
    hosting provider, Cloudflare, may process standard request data, such as IP address and browser
    type, to deliver the site and protect it from abuse.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever you choose to include in your
    message.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your messages and support requests.</li>
    <li>To keep the site secure and working.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

  <h2>Fonts and theme</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses the fonts already on your device, so nothing is loaded from third-party font
    services. If you choose a light or dark theme, that choice is saved in your browser's local
    storage and is never sent to us.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us to access or delete any personal information we hold about you by emailing the
    address below.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE_NAME} · <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
  </p>
</Legal>
